.
lamps are already implemented, however not as you suggest. let's
leave lamps alone and concentrate on your torch. there are two kinds
of torches:  a torch and a burning torch. a torch would be like a
club or staff. a burning torch would add a fire attack to the torch
and instantly light as-discovered dark rooms. drop the one/two
squares issue. if a burning torch is unwielded its flame goes out!
a burning torch can be dropped without going out but it may do fire
damage to you and serves as a "scare monster" item while it continues
to burn. picking up a burning torch puts it out. a burning torch can
additionally be directionally applied whereupon it does fire damage
to the appropriate wood and leather items. engraving with a torch
merely writes in the dust. engraving with a burning torch burns into
the rock and is thus somewhat more enduring.
.
>Torches can burn 200-400 turns.  They are lit with wands of fire (a dragon!)
>or flintstones.  You can NOT easily 'turn off' a torch; ...
